{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And he changed his garments.</b> From here is a hint to what the Rabbis, blessed be their memory, said [in tractate] Rosh HaShanah: Joseph left the prison house — for indeed ויחלף שמלותיו has the gematria of 'on the first of Tishrei.' And it is difficult for me, for I found שמלתיו defective [in] vav, unless one says יש אם למקרא."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {0 "The comment notes that the gematria of ויחלף שמלותיו (with plene vav) equals בחד בתשרי ('on the first of Tishrei'), but the word שמלותיו is written defectively (without vav), which would break the calculation — unless one invokes the principle יש אם למקרא, that readings tradition can supply the missing vav."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:06:54.550409154Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}